<title>NETHERLANDS: Fortis H1 profit up 21 pct.</title>
<headline>Fortis H1 profit up 21 pct.</headline>
<dateline>UTRECHT, Netherlands 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>H1 1996</p>
<p>(millions of ECUs unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>FORTIS GROUP --</p>
<p>    Total income		 9,405  vs   8,635</p>
<p>    Operating profit	     574  vs   476</p>
<p>    Net profit		     366  vs   302</p>
<p>NOTE - Fortis is a banking and insurance group jointly owned by Fortis AG of Belgium and Fortis AMEV of the Netherlands.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
